todoocard_core/quicklz.py

    QuickLZ 1.5 level-3 block encoder/decoder and the T3 controller payload
    wrapper. Ported from the MIT-licensed `todoocard-eink` project
    (https://github.com/shidaifufen/todoocard-eink, quicklz_payload.py).

    The algorithm and byte stream are unchanged; only the module layout and
    docstrings were adjusted for this package.

Protocol / device behaviour reference

    TodooCard/T3 advertisement layout, secure-GATT pairing contract and the
    verified transfer state machine were implemented from public behaviour of
    the official app and the (unlicensed) `Sunbelife/TodooCard_Skills` scripts.
    No Swift source is copied or redistributed here; this package is an
    independent Python implementation.
